<!DOCTYPE html>
<!-- A1 fixture: this is the app-WIDE fallback layout (used by any
     controller with no layout of its own -- posts/ has its own clean one,
     see layouts/posts.html.erb). csrf_meta_tags here proves the transitive
     scan reads the resolved LAYOUT, not just the view: pages#about's own
     view is entirely static, yet must classify unresolved because of this
     file alone. -->
<html><head><%= csrf_meta_tags %></head><body><%= yield %></body></html>
